OL,3,GNEWSASupplies restored after seven
OL,4,Awater mains burst
OL,5,
OL,6,FHomes and businesses on the outskirts
OL,7,Fof Southampton have had water supplies
OL,8,Frestored after seven water mains burst.
OL,10,FSouthern Water said on Friday work was
OL,11,Ftaking place to fix the leaks which
OL,12,Foccured in the Eling, Totton and
OL,13,FMarchwood areas, affecting some 40
OL,14,Fproperties.
OL,16,FIt also confirmed later on Friday
OL,17,Fevening that the Testwood Water Works
OL,18,Fwas operating as normal and producing
OL,19,Fwater.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
